{"hw":"ἀγαθόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀγαθόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀγαθόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">do good to</b> one, <span class=\"gk\">τινί</span> or <span class=\"gk\">τινά</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">1 Ki.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25.31</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Si.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">49.9</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make good,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Numen.</span> </span> ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eus.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PE</cite> </span>&lt;*&gt;<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.22</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>).</div></div>"}